Design influences (no code copied):

- archify by tt-a1i (MIT), https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify
  Orthogonal routing with deterministic endpoint spreading, facing-port
  alignment, label-to-route clearance checks, and the animated flow mode.
  bowerbird's router (lib/layout.mjs) is an independent implementation.

- system-atlas by inkboard (MIT), https://github.com/inkboard/system-atlas
  The idea of an isometric system view. bowerbird's isometric renderer
  (lib/render-iso.mjs) projects its own flat layout and was written
  independently.

Fonts:

- Geist Sans by Vercel, SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  Loaded from Google Fonts in HTML output; embedded in SVG output only when
  the user supplies or has installed the font (bowerbird does not ship it).
